<section class="rigorous-testing"><div class="rigorous-testing__inner"><div class="rigorous-testing__left"><h2 class="rigorous-testing__title">Rigoureuze kwaliteitscontrole die een hogere standaard zet.</h2><p class="rigorous-testing__desc">Eveom™ Astaxanthine wordt als complete formule getest op allergenen,verontreinigingen en pesticiden — want wat er niet in uw supplement zit,is net zo belangrijk.</p></div><div class="rigorous-testing__cards"><div class="rigorous-testing__card"><div class="rigorous-testing__icon"><span style="font-size:32px">🧪</span></div><p class="rigorous-testing__card-text">Geformuleerd zonder gluten,soja en kunstmatige toevoegingen</p></div><div class="rigorous-testing__card"><div class="rigorous-testing__icon"><span style="font-size:32px">🔬</span></div><p class="rigorous-testing__card-text">Getest op zware metalen en vrij van verontreinigingen</p></div><div class="rigorous-testing__card"><div class="rigorous-testing__icon"><span style="font-size:32px">✅</span></div><p class="rigorous-testing__card-text">GMP-gecertificeerd en door derden getest per batch</p></div></div></div></section><style> .rigorous-testing {background-color:#ecebd9;padding:80px 40px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2c4a2c;} .rigorous-testing__inner {max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:60px;} .rigorous-testing__left {flex:1 1 50%;max-width:600px;} .rigorous-testing__title {font-size:44px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:500;color:#1f3a1f;margin:0 0 24px 0;letter-spacing:-0.5px;} .rigorous-testing__desc {font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#2c4a2c;margin:0;max-width:520px;} .rigorous-testing__cards {flex:1 1 50%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;} .rigorous-testing__card {background-color:#f4f3e3;border-radius:14px;padding:28px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:center;min-height:200px;} .rigorous-testing__icon {width:44px;height:44px;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;} .rigorous-testing__icon svg {width:100%;height:100%;} .rigorous-testing__card-text {font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#2c4a2c;margin:0;font-weight:500;} @media (max-width:990px) {.rigorous-testing {padding:60px 24px;} .rigorous-testing__inner {flex-direction:column;gap:40px;} .rigorous-testing__left {max-width:100%;text-align:center;} .rigorous-testing__desc {margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;} .rigorous-testing__title {font-size:34px;} .rigorous-testing__cards {width:100%;}} @media (max-width:640px) {.rigorous-testing__cards {grid-template-columns:1fr;} .rigorous-testing__card {min-height:auto;padding:24px;} .rigorous-testing__title {font-size:28px;}} </style>

